  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 2 - To enable innovative and efficient financing of family planning and broader sexual and reproductive health in Global Financing Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Phase 2 - To enable innovative and efficient financing of family planning and broader sexual and reproductive health in Global Financing Facility  is a component of Global Financing Facility - Phase 2 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;65,000,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Reproductive health care, Family planning, Basic nutrition, Basic sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
